# The host build graph (`tsc -b tsconfig.host.json`) emits the package's
# declarations and JS to lib/types (ignored by the root .gitignore). Spurious
# duplicates can land next to the sources in src/; exclude them so the source
# tree stays clean. This package keeps only .ts sources in src/ (no hand-written
# .d.ts or .js), so these patterns match build output only.
src/**/*.js
src/**/*.js.map
src/**/*.d.ts
src/**/*.d.ts.map
